# Not needed for the re-ingest runbook: `npm run remote` gives its session a one-off
# INGEST_SECRET in a temp env file (docs/REFERENCE.md "Operations"). Copy to .dev.vars
# (gitignored) only for a local `wrangler dev` of your own.
# Committed for `wrangler types --env-file .dev.vars.example`, so generated
# types never depend on a local secret. INGEST_SECRET and EMBEDDING_MODEL are
# optional at runtime and declared by hand in src/env.d.ts; they are left
# commented out here so the generated Env does not mark them required.
# INGEST_SECRET=<openssl rand -hex 24>
# EMBEDDING_MODEL=@cf/baai/bge-small-en-v1.5
